# Canonical site URL — used by metadataBase, canonicals, sitemap,
# robots and the Open Graph image. Set this in Vercel's env vars to
# the live domain after deploy (no trailing slash). If it is unset,
# Vercel's own production URL is used; locally it falls back to
# http://localhost:3000.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://haider-zaman-portfolio.vercel.app

# AI Portfolio Assistant (server-side only).
# The assistant answers only from the curated knowledge base in
# src/lib/assistant-knowledge.ts. The key is read server-side in
# src/lib/assistant.ts and is never sent to the browser.
# If the key is absent, the assistant answers extractively from the
# same knowledge base and says so — it never invents.
# Never commit a real key here or in a .env file.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
